WEBVTT

00:00.710 --> 00:03.380
Attention!

00:04.300 --> 00:08.970
I will now explain to you the details
of the Trost Recovery Operation!

00:09.180 --> 00:11.930
Let me start by introducing this fellow!

00:12.140 --> 00:16.770
This is Eren Jaeger,
a member of the Cadets!

00:16.980 --> 00:19.440
He is the successful result

00:19.650 --> 00:23.110
of our top-secret Titan
transformation experiments!

00:23.320 --> 00:28.030
In Titan form, he will lift that
giant rock near the front gate,

00:28.240 --> 00:30.200
carry it to the wrecked gate,

00:30.410 --> 00:32.240
and seal the hole!

00:32.450 --> 00:34.410
As for you,

00:34.620 --> 00:40.130
you're to defend him from the
other Titans while he carries the rock!

00:40.330 --> 00:42.920
Should this operation succeed,

00:43.130 --> 00:48.930
humanity will have taken back land
from the Titans for the very first time!

00:49.140 --> 00:53.810
Indeed, it may
seem extraordinarily small

00:54.010 --> 00:57.850
when compared to what
humanity has given up this far!

00:58.060 --> 00:59.440
However...!

00:59.650 --> 01:03.150
For humankind,
that single, small step...

01:03.360 --> 01:05.440
...will be a great leap forward!

01:19.750 --> 01:22.040
Eren! Don't you recognize me?!

01:22.250 --> 01:23.880
I'm Mikasa!

01:24.090 --> 01:26.340
Part of your family!

01:26.550 --> 01:28.470
Dodge, Ackermann!

01:31.800 --> 01:33.180
What the hell?!

01:33.390 --> 01:36.180
He's just a regular, dumb Titan!

01:36.390 --> 01:37.770
Change of plans!

01:37.980 --> 01:41.650
We're to defend Jaeger from the
other Titans until we can recover him!

01:41.850 --> 01:44.570
He holds a precious chance for humanity.

01:44.770 --> 01:47.320
We can't abandon him just like that!

01:49.740 --> 01:51.570
Where am I?

01:55.120 --> 01:56.740
I'm home...

01:58.700 --> 01:59.790
Jean!

02:00.000 --> 02:02.540
Why isn't he using his ODM gear?!

02:03.540 --> 02:04.460
Oh no!

02:04.670 --> 02:06.670
Don't tell me it's malfunctioning?!

02:06.880 --> 02:08.260
I'll manage somehow!

02:08.460 --> 02:09.840
Mikasa!

02:10.050 --> 02:11.220
What happened to the plan?!

02:11.430 --> 02:12.640
It's failed!

02:12.840 --> 02:16.100
We're fighting because
we can't leave Eren behind!

02:16.310 --> 02:18.430
But there are too many Titans...

02:18.640 --> 02:21.060
At this rate, we'll be wiped out!

02:24.060 --> 02:26.230
From the back of the head
to the nape of the neck...

02:26.440 --> 02:30.360
...one meter high and
ten centimeters across!

02:32.320 --> 02:35.200
Eren... Answer me...

02:35.410 --> 02:40.500
Even though just one step outside
the wall lies a hellish world...

02:40.700 --> 02:46.040
Why did you want to
venture into the outside world?!

02:47.880 --> 02:49.300
Why?

02:50.760 --> 02:51.920
Because...

02:52.130 --> 02:54.590
...I was born in this world!

03:03.230 --> 03:04.650
Eren!

03:23.290 --> 03:28.130
Unknown are the names
of the flowers that have been trampled

03:28.340 --> 03:33.590
Birds have fallen to the earth
and long for the wind

03:33.800 --> 03:38.680
Prayers won't solve anything

03:38.890 --> 03:44.020
Only the will to fight
can change the here and now!

03:44.230 --> 03:49.320
O pigs who laugh at the resolve
to walk over corpses to move forward

03:49.520 --> 03:51.860
Livestock complacency? False prosperity?

03:52.070 --> 03:54.740
Give us the freedom of dying,
starving wolves!

03:54.950 --> 04:00.120
The humiliation of being caged
is what triggers us to fight back

04:00.330 --> 04:05.410
We hunters slaughter prey
beyond the castle walls,

04:05.620 --> 04:10.630
consumed with surging bloodlust,

04:10.840 --> 04:17.760
as our crimson bows and arrows
pierce scarlet holes into the twilight

04:40.009 --> 04:45.014
Primal Desire: The Struggle for Trost, Part 9

04:52.800 --> 04:57.300
Damn... I can't believe I'm
draggin' everyone down...

05:09.980 --> 05:13.230
Will this really work out somehow?

05:19.200 --> 05:21.450
We can't go on, Captain!

05:22.030 --> 05:24.870
It's just us now!

05:26.410 --> 05:28.580
Let's fall back to the rock for now!

05:33.880 --> 05:35.500
Situation report!

05:35.960 --> 05:38.260
Five Titans coming from the gate!

05:49.850 --> 05:53.310
There's no way I can just sit
around and wait until the coast is clear!

05:53.520 --> 05:54.900
Jean!

05:55.110 --> 05:57.360
So his gear is busted!

05:57.570 --> 05:59.190
What's going on?!

06:01.240 --> 06:02.160
Crap!

06:02.360 --> 06:03.660
What the hell?!

06:03.870 --> 06:06.950
Damn it! Of all the times...!

06:09.370 --> 06:11.330
Jean! Stay calm!

06:14.500 --> 06:15.590
Marco!

06:15.790 --> 06:17.630
What are you doing?!

06:28.930 --> 06:29.930
Man!

06:30.140 --> 06:32.060
Don't go causin' trouble for us!

06:42.650 --> 06:46.740
Damn! Why is the trigger so stiff?!

06:50.330 --> 06:51.750
Jean!

06:55.500 --> 06:56.920
Oww!

06:57.840 --> 06:59.210
What are you doing?!

06:59.420 --> 07:02.170
Same to you! Now get outta there!

07:34.710 --> 07:35.920
You guys are damn reckless!

07:36.130 --> 07:37.460
No, you are!

07:37.670 --> 07:39.710
That scared the hell out of me!

07:41.630 --> 07:43.050
Look!

08:17.710 --> 08:18.920
Eren...

08:19.130 --> 08:20.540
Mikasa!

08:22.500 --> 08:23.550
Armin!

08:23.760 --> 08:25.380
Eren prevailed!

08:25.590 --> 08:28.930
He's trying to fulfill
his responsibility now!

08:29.140 --> 08:32.310
Now if we just cover
him until he reaches the gate...

08:32.510 --> 08:34.890
...victory will be ours!

08:39.440 --> 08:41.060
Defend him!

08:41.610 --> 08:44.070
Even if it costs us our lives...

08:44.280 --> 08:46.530
...we must let Eren reach the gate!

08:46.740 --> 08:50.280
Do not let the Titans get near him!

08:50.490 --> 08:54.160
We gotta give Eren backup! Keep 'em off him!

08:56.500 --> 08:59.580
You two head to Eren!

08:59.790 --> 09:02.460
That's an order! Is that clear?!

09:02.670 --> 09:04.090
Yes, Sir!

09:07.840 --> 09:08.970
The Mitabi team!

09:09.180 --> 09:10.680
What are you doing?!

09:10.890 --> 09:13.010
The Titans are ignoring us now!

09:13.220 --> 09:16.480
Our only choice is to get close
enough to grab their attention!

09:16.680 --> 09:18.440
Look this way, damn it!

09:18.640 --> 09:23.730
Or else we'll shove our blades
up your smelly asses and kill you!

09:26.990 --> 09:28.990
- Here they come!
- We got two of 'em!

09:29.200 --> 09:32.070
Run! Run for the buildings!

09:32.280 --> 09:33.450
That's insane!

09:33.660 --> 09:36.080
Setting foot down there is suicide!

09:36.290 --> 09:39.460
And they have no way to
fight without horses or buildings!

09:39.670 --> 09:44.670
No... That's the only option now.

09:47.630 --> 09:49.720
Follow Mitabi Team!

09:49.930 --> 09:52.390
Armin. We need to go, too.

09:55.010 --> 09:55.810
This way!

09:56.010 --> 09:57.980
Come get me!

10:05.610 --> 10:07.360
My body feels...

10:07.570 --> 10:10.700
...like it's about to be crushed into a pulp...

10:12.110 --> 10:15.410
Mikasa... Armin...

10:15.620 --> 10:16.870
What are you doing?

10:17.080 --> 10:21.290
You'll end up Titan food if
you walk around down there...!

10:21.500 --> 10:24.460
C'mon! Hurry this way, you slowpoke!

10:24.670 --> 10:26.090
Come get me!

10:28.760 --> 10:30.170
H-Hey!

10:31.720 --> 10:33.140
Mitabi!

10:39.060 --> 10:40.430
Why did you want

10:40.640 --> 10:43.520
to venture into
the outside world?

10:46.610 --> 10:51.320
From the moment
we're born, we're all...

10:51.530 --> 10:52.950
...free...

10:55.370 --> 11:01.330
Some might try to deny that,
but it doesn't matter how strong they are!

11:02.370 --> 11:07.880
Fiery waters... Lands of ice...
Or whatever else!

11:08.090 --> 11:10.340
Whoever gets to see those things

11:10.550 --> 11:14.630
will have the greatest
freedom this world has to offer!

11:16.350 --> 11:18.100
Fight!

11:18.310 --> 11:21.060
If anything is worth
giving your life, it's that!

11:23.350 --> 11:27.480
It doesn't matter how
terrifying the world may be!

11:29.900 --> 11:34.450
It doesn't matter
how cruel the world may be!

11:35.240 --> 11:36.660
Fight!

11:37.280 --> 11:38.700
Fight!

11:39.410 --> 11:40.830
Fight!

11:41.450 --> 11:42.870
Fight!

11:46.500 --> 11:48.380
There's still a Titan ahead!

11:50.050 --> 11:52.010
I'll handle this!

11:54.420 --> 11:57.180
Out of the way!

12:19.070 --> 12:22.370
Go, Eren!

12:23.370 --> 12:24.790
Fight!

12:50.400 --> 12:51.980
Everyone...

12:52.190 --> 12:55.690
Your deaths weren't in vain...

13:01.120 --> 13:04.830
Today, for the first time in history...

13:05.040 --> 13:07.710
...humanity has beaten the Titans!

13:07.910 --> 13:09.960
Yellow smoke shell spotted!

13:10.170 --> 13:13.670
It seems the operation...
was a success!

13:14.920 --> 13:17.340
Send in additional reinforcements!

13:17.550 --> 13:20.300
Rescue the Elite Squad!

13:36.900 --> 13:39.280
The remaining Titans are coming!

13:39.490 --> 13:41.070
Head up the wall!

13:41.280 --> 13:43.780
I'll withdraw after I've recovered Eren!

13:45.580 --> 13:47.580
Armin! How's Eren?!

13:47.790 --> 13:50.500
He's unbelievably hot to the touch!

13:50.710 --> 13:54.500
We need to hurry...
and get him up the wall...!

13:57.340 --> 14:00.050
Part of his body is fused to it!

14:00.260 --> 14:02.970
- I can't pull him free!
- Then we'll have to cut!

14:03.180 --> 14:05.600
W-Wait! Please!

14:17.610 --> 14:19.780
Eren! Armin!

14:39.920 --> 14:41.340
Mikasa...

14:41.550 --> 14:42.340
Huh?!

14:42.550 --> 14:44.050
Those are...

14:46.600 --> 14:48.810
The wings...

14:49.020 --> 14:50.850
...of freedom...

14:56.940 --> 14:59.610
Hey. You kids.

14:59.820 --> 15:02.900
What exactly is going on here?

15:08.580 --> 15:10.830
Afterward, thanks to the actions

15:11.040 --> 15:15.380
of the Scout Regiment and the
Garrison Regiment's Corps of Engineers,

15:15.580 --> 15:19.880
Wall Rose once
again held the Titans at bay.

15:22.920 --> 15:28.600
Taking out the rest of the Titans
trapped inside Trost took a full day,

15:28.810 --> 15:33.020
during which the wall-mounted
cannons fired nonstop.

15:35.150 --> 15:37.310
Most of the Titans that
had gathered by the wall

15:37.520 --> 15:39.610
were wiped out by explosive shells.

15:39.820 --> 15:45.610
The few that remained were
mostly mopped up by the Scouts.

15:47.660 --> 15:52.250
During this, one 4-meter
Titan and one 7-meter Titan

15:52.450 --> 15:55.830
were successfully captured alive.

15:56.040 --> 15:57.790
However...

15:58.000 --> 16:01.420
207 people were dead or missing,

16:01.630 --> 16:04.630
and 897 were injured.

16:04.840 --> 16:09.010
Although this was the first time
humanity had stopped a Titan invasion,

16:09.220 --> 16:15.730
far too many people had been lost
to celebrate this historic achievement.

16:36.160 --> 16:37.580
Hey...

16:43.710 --> 16:45.300
Are you...

16:45.510 --> 16:47.590
...Marco?

16:50.510 --> 16:53.720
Do you know his name, cadet?

16:53.930 --> 16:55.350
I wondered where he was...

16:55.560 --> 17:00.520
But... he's the last person who would ever...

17:00.730 --> 17:02.440
Marco...

17:02.650 --> 17:04.230
What happened?

17:05.400 --> 17:10.320
D-Did someone... anyone...
see how he went out?

17:10.530 --> 17:12.030
What is his name?

17:12.240 --> 17:15.040
Tell me if you know. Quickly.

17:18.000 --> 17:20.250
Do you understand, cadet?

17:20.460 --> 17:23.550
Two days have passed since
we sealed the hole with the rock.

17:23.750 --> 17:27.260
Yet we still haven't
rounded up all the bodies.

17:27.470 --> 17:31.180
At this rate,
an epidemic could break out.

17:31.390 --> 17:34.350
We must prevent a secondary disaster.

17:34.560 --> 17:37.770
There's no time to lament our
comrades' deaths yet.

17:37.980 --> 17:39.600
Understand?

17:43.570 --> 17:49.570
Member of the 104th Cadet Corps
and Captain of Squad 19...

17:49.780 --> 17:52.240
...Marco Bodt.

17:52.450 --> 17:53.580
Marco.

17:53.780 --> 17:56.080
I'm glad you knew his name.

17:56.290 --> 17:58.250
Let's continue.

18:08.590 --> 18:10.880
What is this...?

18:13.220 --> 18:15.260
Leftover Titan vomit.

18:15.470 --> 18:17.520
Apparently they don't
have digestive systems,

18:17.720 --> 18:21.900
so they puke people out like
that once they've had their fill.

18:22.100 --> 18:23.940
You can't be serious...

18:24.150 --> 18:28.690
Damn... There's no way of
telling who's who in there!

18:32.240 --> 18:33.870
I'm sorry...

18:37.290 --> 18:39.580
I'm sorry...

18:39.790 --> 18:41.960
It's no use apologizing.

18:42.170 --> 18:44.380
We need to hurry and give them a funeral.

19:09.610 --> 19:12.070
Have any questions?

19:13.200 --> 19:18.490
Commander Erwin, the head of
the Scouts Regiment's Task Force...

19:19.660 --> 19:21.660
...and Captain Levi!

19:22.580 --> 19:24.000
U-Umm...

19:26.130 --> 19:29.630
Where... am I?

19:34.550 --> 19:38.720
It should be obvious.
Let's just say it's a dungeon.

19:38.930 --> 19:42.560
You're currently in the
custody of the Military Police.

19:42.770 --> 19:47.230
Only just now were
we permitted to see you.

19:49.900 --> 19:50.860
That key...!

19:51.070 --> 19:53.530
Yes. It's yours.

19:53.740 --> 19:55.450
I'll return it later.

19:55.660 --> 20:00.580
Dr. Jaeger's basement,
in your home in Shiganshina...

20:00.790 --> 20:04.330
A secret surrounding
the Titans is there, correct?

20:04.540 --> 20:06.710
Yes. I think so.

20:06.920 --> 20:09.130
That's what my father said.

20:09.340 --> 20:13.420
And you've lost your memory,
and your old man's gone missing...

20:13.630 --> 20:16.300
Pretty convenient story, if you ask me.

20:16.510 --> 20:17.890
Levi.

20:18.090 --> 20:22.020
We've already concluded he
has no reason to lie. You know that.

20:22.220 --> 20:24.230
There is still so little we know,

20:24.430 --> 20:28.730
but for now, I feel the most important
thing is to ask about your intentions.

20:28.940 --> 20:31.690
My intentions?

20:32.570 --> 20:34.780
If we want to check out your home,

20:34.990 --> 20:39.160
we'll need to take back
Shiganshina District along Wall Maria.

20:40.120 --> 20:45.370
Sealing the damaged gate there would
be the best way to accomplish that.

20:45.580 --> 20:48.420
Which means we'll need your Titan ability.

20:49.670 --> 20:53.840
Naturally, it's a Titan
that will determine our fate.

20:54.050 --> 20:57.300
The Colossal Titan
and the Armored Titan

20:57.510 --> 21:00.300
most likely work the same way as you.

21:01.970 --> 21:04.350
Your intentions are the key.

21:04.560 --> 21:08.810
The key to saving humankind from this despair.

21:11.400 --> 21:13.020
I'm...

21:16.990 --> 21:19.360
I'm going to drive out...

21:19.570 --> 21:23.950
...every last one from this world!

21:24.160 --> 21:27.460
Hey. Answer the damn question, you twit.

21:27.660 --> 21:30.290
What do you want to do?

21:34.630 --> 21:37.090
I want to join the Scouts...

21:37.300 --> 21:40.680
...and slaughter every Titan I can!

21:42.390 --> 21:45.220
Ah. Not bad.

21:49.310 --> 21:53.310
Erwin. I'll take responsibility for him.

21:53.520 --> 21:55.820
Let the higher-ups know.

21:56.030 --> 21:58.990
I don't necessarily trust him, though.

21:59.200 --> 22:01.410
If he betrays us or goes out of control,

22:01.610 --> 22:04.120
I'll kill him on the spot.

22:04.330 --> 22:06.290
The top brass won't complain.

22:06.490 --> 22:09.410
Because I'm the only one cut out for this.

22:09.620 --> 22:11.500
You're in.

22:11.710 --> 22:15.040
I'll make you a member of the Scouts.

22:36.360 --> 22:41.280
Your dreams are where your heart is

22:41.490 --> 22:47.540
They're more fragile than life itself

22:47.740 --> 22:52.210
Over and over you cast them aside,
only to find more

22:52.420 --> 22:58.880
Now, rest in peace

22:59.090 --> 23:10.220
Pounding impulses defile the things we wish for

23:10.430 --> 23:20.490
and the more we forget
the more we remember again

23:20.690 --> 23:26.450
In this beautiful, cruel world

23:26.660 --> 23:31.620
all I can do is ask why we're still alive

23:31.830 --> 23:37.340
Oh, with our strength... and our weakness...

23:37.540 --> 23:43.010
what are we going to protect if there's no sense

23:43.220 --> 23:46.640
to anything anymore?

23:53.480 --> 23:55.730
A special court-martial.

23:55.940 --> 23:58.520
After being held in an underground cell,

23:58.730 --> 24:02.150
Eren is dragged into a courthouse
filled with the heads of each regiment.

24:02.360 --> 24:05.382
What happens there will
determine whether he lives or dies.

24:05.382 --> 24:06.780
Can't Look into His Eyes Yet: Eve of the Counterattack, Part 1
What happens there will
determine whether he lives or dies.

24:06.780 --> 24:06.966
Can't Look into His Eyes Yet: Eve of the Counterattack, Part 1
